    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let go of the body\"... that sounds so peaceful when you put it that way. like everything is just finally quiet. but it's scary to think about. everyone keeps telling me to \"fight\" and \"find a new passion,\" but they don't get it. how can there be a new passion when the core of me is just gone? it feels like I'm just dragging this heavy, useless weight around every single day.",
